<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We have endless treasure found;</l><l>We have all things and abound;</l><l>Rich abundance and to spare;</l><l>Shall we not the blessing share?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For, while we are feasting here,</l><l>Starving millions, far and near,</l><l>Call us with the bitter cry:</l><l>Come and help us, or we die.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In this day of full increase,</l><l>Shall we, can we, hold our peace?</l><l>Staying here we do not well;</l><l>Now then, let us go and tell:</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Tell how He hath set us free,</l><l>How He leads triumphantly;</l><l>How He satisfies our need;</l><l>How His rest is rest indeed.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Speak, for we, Thy servants, hear;</l><l>Thou hast taught us not to fear;</l><l>And whate’er Thy word shall be,</l><l>We can do it, Lord, in Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
